          "content": "By the end of this unit, the reader should be able to investigate adaptation, plasticity and experimental evolution, interpret a relevant quantitative model, design a realistic test that controls for alternative explanations, and state the principal limits of the inference. An intellectually satisfactory answer can remain uncertain when the data do not discriminate among mechanisms.",
